026","note":"更新至20集","actor":"方瑾 / 李嘉豪 / 王鹤宇 / 孙莉 / 黄奕搏","director":"修潇楠 / 李忠贺","des":"<p>　讲述了顶流网红顾小糖的豪门婚礼，竟成她被丈夫、闺蜜、经纪公司联手谋杀的现场，她被困在婚礼当天无限死亡轮回。经历几次惨死轮回，顾小糖觉醒后，利用“无限复活”诅咒，携手跟随她穿越轮回的医生叶深，对仇人展开复仇。当以为即将胜利时，循环提前至悲剧发生一周前，顾小糖不再只满足于婚礼当天反击，而是要从根本上斩断痛苦源头，为自己和所爱之人杀出光明未来。</p>","last":"2026-08-30 12:17:21","sources":[{"sourceName":"360资源 (360zy)","sourceUrl":"https://360zy.com/api.php/provide/vod/","from":"360zy","links":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://vod1.maowushi.com/20260819/Yr1sVS2W/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://vod1.maowushi.com/20260819/aJ3U3RYE/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://vod1.maowushi.com/20260819/Cacvc3bU/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://vod1.maowushi.com/20260819/c0gYVQZO/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://vod1.maowushi.com/20260819/t21mDgap/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://vod1.maowushi.com/20260819/29lpm9SU/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://vod1.maowushi.com/20260820/iJ7hd5bx/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://vod1.maowushi.com/20260820/lRPFh0w9/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://vod1.maowushi.com/20260821/DLUBmWqV/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://vod1.maowushi.com/20260821/P65dLPK1/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://vod1.maowushi.com/20260822/guLgLsPn/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://vod1.maowushi.com/20260822/N6qksP6v/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第13集","url":"https://vod1.maowushi.com/20260823/z2QOgUxM/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第14集","url":"https://vod1.maowushi.com/20260824/oUq20O92/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第15集","url":"https://vod1.maowushi.com/20260825/LY4s6jT6/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第16集","url":"https://vod1.maowushi.com/20260826/0Qlqx2CI/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第17集","url":"https://vod1.maowushi.com/20260827/liKXPabe/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第18集","url":"https://vod1.maowushi.com/20260828/3cGIwR1a/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第19集","url":"https://vod1.maowushi.com/20260829/bygqbXRm/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第20集","url":"https://vod1.maowushi.com/20260830/9sjeuPyU/index.m3u8"}]},{"so