而来，不想，海川的父亲吴大宝就是祥云村人，大宝回村探亲，遇见儿子，引来刘天祥暴怒，这才引出一段埋藏了20多年的往事。父辈的恩怨阻挡着刘思宇和于海川的爱情之路，这给一直喜欢海川的都市女孩魏冬雪和村里一直喜欢刘思宇的有志青年萧强以机会。刘思宇和于海川冲破层层阻隔，为爱，刘思宇守着孤独，爱的艰辛；为爱，海川不惜背在父母在思宇母亲灵前定亲……二人为爱在祥云村创业，恢复停产的村饲料厂；创建奶牛养殖基地；深化土地流转；打造祥云度假村，发慌乡村第三产业，刘思宇接过父亲带领村民致富的接力棒。一对情侣一路闯过诸多难关，享受着祥云美景，也享受着来之不易的爱情。</p>","last":"2026-08-30 12:16:02","sources":[{"sourceName":"360资源 (360zy)","sourceUrl":"https://360zy.com/api.php/provide/vod/","from":"360zy","links":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://vod1.maowushi.com/20260817/jWx2R3HP/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://vod1.maowushi.com/20260817/wubXxLig/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://vod1.maowushi.com/20260817/fTH2l1si/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://vod1.maowushi.com/20260817/Wn1QKwNj/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://vod1.maowushi.com/20260817/PV3sqZYQ/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://vod1.maowushi.com/20260817/YVfKvocY/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://vod1.maowushi.com/20260817/sJcgcJFn/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://vod1.maowushi.com/20260817/PZd2C1ko/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://vod1.maowushi.com/20260817/GcgY0TAJ/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://vod1.maowushi.com/20260817/m6huu1FE/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://vod1.maowushi.com/20260818/fVs3oqmL/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://vod1.maowushi.com/20260818/mSSHGvhx/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第13集","url":"https://vod1.maowushi.com/20260819/iPROXvXR/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第14集","url":"https://vod1.maowushi.com/20260819/cKyAq3zz/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第15集","url":"https://vod1.maowushi.com/20260820/NYnIDMdg/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第16集","url":"https://vod1.maowushi.com/20260820/0iA70VJ0/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第17集","url":"https://vod1.maowushi.com/20260821/Hyacjmdv/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第18集","url":"https://vod1.maowushi.com/20260821/3JIvrSKA/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第19集","url":"https://vod1.maowushi.com/20260823/do1pKd4C/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第20集","url":"https://vod1.maowushi.com/20260823/xF0SljVV/index.m