3u8","links":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://v.lzcdn27.com/20260814/15399_7329c63b/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://v.lzcdn27.com/20260814/15400_833aaec8/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://v.lzcdn27.com/20260815/15458_07269cde/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://v.lzcdn27.com/20260815/15459_a4a340b3/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://v.lzcdn27.com/20260816/15511_45cf75aa/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://v.lzcdn27.com/20260817/15548_e015df59/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://v.lzcdn27.com/20260817/15547_610ae662/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://v.lzcdn27.com/20260818/15589_c5aef576/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://v.lzcdn27.com/20260818/15590_bcd04dbc/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://v.lzcdn27.com/20260819/15655_174145b3/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://v.lzcdn27.com/20260819/15656_cdc05590/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://v.lzcdn27.com/20260820/15716_f6363189/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第13集","url":"https://v.lzcdn27.com/20260820/15715_561b4691/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第14集","url":"https://v.lzcdn27.com/20260821/15793_43efb1f8/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第15集","url":"https://v.lzcdn27.com/20260821/15794_a54c8ea5/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第16集","url":"https://v.lzcdn27.com/20260822/15843_d4055963/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第17集","url":"https://v.lzcdn27.com/20260822/15842_180f19df/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第18集","url":"https://v.lzcdn27.com/20260823/15883_6c14081b/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第19集","url":"https://v.lzcdn27.com/20260824/15948_22329fc0/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第20集","url":"https://v.lzcdn27.com/20260824/15949_c383deaf/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第21集","url":"https://v.lzcdn27.com/20260825/16010_b234c8ee/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第22集","url":"https://v.lzcdn27.com/20260826/16074_df7e5976/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第23集","url":"https://v.lzcdn27.com/20260826/16075_b0bdd2e5/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第24集","url":"https://v.lzcdn27.com/20260827/16131_123228ca/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第25集","url":"https://v.lzcdn27.com/20260827/16130_a40eaec8/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第26集","url":"https://v.lzcdn27.com/20260828/16180_a79cef5f/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第27集","url":"https://v.lzcdn27.com/20260828/16179_6c3cb96f/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第28集","url":"https://v.lzcdn27.com/20260829/16213_a21b33c4/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第29集","url":"https://v.lzcdn27.com/20260829/16212_250408d5/index.m3u8"}]}]},{"id":"afde7e1db84de60ad7064ebd34300042","title":"特战英雄榜","type":"dianshi","typeName":"国产剧","pic":"https://www.imgzy360.com:7788/upload/vod/20260822-1/fcb4dbba7c2290a0bc8cc0028726ff32.webp","lang":"汉语普通话","area":"中国大陆","year":"2026","note":"更新至第14集","actor":"张铎 / 刘梦珂 / 张笑君","director":"彭景泉","des":"<p>1938年，关四斤（张铎 饰）率领的江南游击队被改编加入了新四军，延安派来的军政干部余纯良（郭家铭饰），锄奸科长王时光（王红舟 饰）和刚参军的冷珊（刘梦珂 饰）等人也加入了部队。而国民党也派出团长庞涛（安龙 饰）收编关四斤部。同时，反动武装燃香会头目彪哥（施展 饰），双料间谍李道余（李为民 饰），还有民间武装首领燕竹（汪芦云 饰），都成为关四的作战对手。面对错综复杂的作战局势，关四斤和余纯良与各种敌对武装展开了艰苦卓绝的斗争。“皖南事变”后关四斤(张铎饰)因犯错被划为死刑犯，与庞涛、彪哥、李道余、泥鳅（林扬 饰）、马奇（张笑君 饰）、燕竹、吕大钟（张昊智 饰）和谢巧妹（宋欣洁 饰）八人被押往苏北。途中屡次遭遇日军及反动势力的围堵，为团结和争取一切可以抗战的力量，关四斤等人以坚定的革命信念和大智大勇，经受了前所未有的严酷考验，迎来了最后的胜利。</p>","last":"2026-08-29 21:59:04","sources":[{"sourceName":"360资源 (360zy)","sourceUrl":"https://360zy.com/api.php/provide/vod/","from":"360zy","links":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://vod1.maowushi.com/20260822/ewDxk46r/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://vod1.maowushi.com/20260822/p3D6NSDF/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://vod1.maowushi.com/20260822/Az9zOLBi/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://vod1.maowushi.com/20260822/4pJGPnYu/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://vod1.maowushi.com/20260822/7s9EEJN2/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://vod1.maowushi.com/20260822/E6Q2RhRR/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://vod1.maowushi.com/20260822/iFDu6yRN/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://vod1.maowushi.com/20260823/ThJDiAU1/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://vod1.maowushi.com/20260824/usugYSz4/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://vod1.maowushi.com/20260825/5hAoY80C/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集